{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When our family inherited a bare, empty house on the outskirts of town, we saw more than just four walls\u2014we saw endless potential. With nothing but dusty floorboards and blank rooms, we set up our only true passion in the old garage: furniture renovation. Our goal is simple but heartfelt: breathe new life into forgotten pieces, fill the house with warm, lovingly restored furniture, and surprise Mom with a home she\u2019ll cherish for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully equipped workshop stocked with a wide array of tools: coarse sandpaper for stripping away decades of wear, precision paintbrushes in every size, high-pressure spray guns for flawless coats, and soft polishing pads to reveal a showroom finish. As you progress, unlock and upgrade each tool, tailoring your kit to tackle ever more challenging restoration projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to an intuitive first-person aiming system, every swipe, stroke, and polish feels remarkably real. Line up each tool with pinpoint accuracy\u2014zero in on hard-to-reach corners, adjust brush size on the fly, and watch your work unfold in stunning real time. The satisfying tactile feedback makes each restoration a true craftsmanship experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve revived a dresser, chair, or heirloom table, it\u2019s time to share your creations with the neighborhood. Host your own garage sales right outside the workshop: display your finest pieces, haggle with eager buyers, and earn funds you\u2019ll reinvest into rare materials and advanced tool upgrades. In <strong>Furniture Restoration Simulator: Garage Edition</strong>, every project is a step closer to turning a house into a loving home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859070?t=1768926403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859070?t=1768926403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/b690faf1b10f652e327717cc6d989c37f99e6454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768926403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/b690faf1b10f652e327717cc6d989c37f99e6454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768926403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Support Us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/64c446e5f95e95ba57580d14ab23ff7c.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/64c446e5f95e95ba57580d14ab23ff7c.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/64c446e5f95e95ba57580d14ab23ff7c.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When our family inherited a bare, empty house on the outskirts of town, we saw more than just four walls\u2014we saw endless potential. With nothing but dusty floorboards and blank rooms, we set up our only true passion in the old garage: furniture renovation. Our goal is simple but heartfelt: breathe new life into forgotten pieces, fill the house with warm, lovingly restored furniture, and surprise Mom with a home she\u2019ll cherish for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/e58390134006b0fa62f08f71c2225349.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully equipped workshop stocked with a wide array of tools: coarse sandpaper for stripping away decades of wear, precision paintbrushes in every size, high-pressure spray guns for flawless coats, and soft polishing pads to reveal a showroom finish. As you progress, unlock and upgrade each tool, tailoring your kit to tackle ever more challenging restoration projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/f193e6273b874ccbdf82285ee691f806.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to an intuitive first-person aiming system, every swipe, stroke, and polish feels remarkably real. Line up each tool with pinpoint accuracy\u2014zero in on hard-to-reach corners, adjust brush size on the fly, and watch your work unfold in stunning real time. The satisfying tactile feedback makes each restoration a true craftsmanship experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.poster.avif?t=1768926403\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.webm?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/extras/7cb9849bdc17c69e12dbd77ae28e9438.mp4?t=1768926403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve revived a dresser, chair, or heirloom table, it\u2019s time to share your creations with the neighborhood. Host your own garage sales right outside the workshop: display your finest pieces, haggle with eager buyers, and earn funds you\u2019ll reinvest into rare materials and advanced tool upgrades. In <strong>Furniture Restoration Simulator: Garage Edition</strong>, every project is a step closer to turning a house into a loving home.</p>","developers":["Icelake Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859070/0baf9f6090857d1a8f2416f57c773868bded9454/header.jpg?t=1768926403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859070/37995546/a3481827ead52ea1a5767af4f35d0c6c89ffe059/1768830926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768832396","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859070/37995546/a3481827ead52ea1a5767af4f35d0c6c89ffe059/1768830926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768832396","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859070/37995546/a3481827ead52ea1a5767af4f35d0c6c89ffe059/1768830926/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768832396","id":257267995,"name":"Furniture Restoration Simulator - New Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257267995/88749ec6d1c4ed2f2bf0960c91094e941eaa6873/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768832396"}],"name":"Furniture Restoration Sim