 vibrant paints, and polish each piece to a showroom finish\u2014one satisfying restoration at a time.","steam_appid":3859070,"support_info":{"email":"ekrembuzlugol@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish","type":"game","website":null}